'''KAITO & Cat''' are a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 591
|rarity = SR
|name1 = KAITO & Cat
|name2 = KAITO & Cat CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''KAITO & Cat CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
KAITO should be used to tank zombie enemies, as it has lots of health for them specifically. His DPS is low so he shouldn't be used for damage. He has low amounts of knockbacks so he can tank effectively, and he has rather good cooldown for his role.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker}}

